{"ID":"20240118151108-qaitlbe","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151108-qaitlbe","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151108-qaitlbe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151108-tyfuubs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135523-f6j18p8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135523-f6j18p8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:229,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:229\u0026#125;","title":"221合欢","type":"doc","updated":"20240201173517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151108-tyfuubs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151108-tyfuubs","updated":"20240122135513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，平，无毒。主安五脏，和心志，令人欢乐无忧。久服轻身，明目，得所欲。生山谷。一名蠲忿，一名夜合。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135516-5w0n58l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135516-5w0n58l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】山中有之。皮供药用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135517-olsqmwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135517-olsqmwd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】合欢皮味甘，性平。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135519-ukgqxi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135519-ukgqxi4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为合血，消肿，止痛药，治筋骨折伤及肺痈吐脓。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135520-zyji3so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135520-zyji3so"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】煎膏消痈肿，续筋骨。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135521-b58chol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135521-b58chol"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般二至四钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135522-2ulnll1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135522-2ulnll1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无禁忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135514-7zyrvwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135514-7zyrvwp"}},{"ID":"20240122135522-94u96er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135522-94u96er"}},{"ID":"20240122135523-f6j18p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135523-f6j18p8","updated":"20240201173517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看，这合欢呢就长这个样子。这个合欢皮味道是甘味的，看它的名字就知道，合欢嘛，令人欢乐无忧，吃下去就会很开心。西药也有开心的药，中药也有，合欢皮，一名夜合，那这个合欢呢主治活血消肿，止痛的药，一般在筋骨的折伤还有情绪不好的时候我们会加一些合欢下去，让心情变好，张仲景，在肺痈呕吐脓血的时候，会用到合欢。一般来说消肿还有续筋骨都可以使用合欢，所以合欢的用途蛮多的，它的味甘，甘味的药都有一点滋补的功能在里面。这个药没什么禁忌。后面开始呢，是些动物性的药。"}]}]}